stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> READY: ground_state ∈ {COMPLETE, SUCCESS, GROUND_DONE}
    READY --> DISPATCH: mission_request == true
    DISPATCH --> FLIGHT: send /drone/flight_command (TAKEOFF)
    DISPATCH --> GROUND: keep /arena/ground/state alive
    FLIGHT --> COMPLETE: flight landed + payload_released
    FLIGHT --> ABORT: LAND / ABORT safety override
    ABORT --> COMPLETE: /drone/navigation/state == COMPLETE
    GROUND --> [*]: arena teardown (post-submission)
    COMPLETE --> [*]

    note right of IDLE
        MissionGate emits exactly one
        mission_request after a single ground completion.
        Re-dispatch is suppressed even if the ground state
        re-enters COMPLETE.
    end note

    note right of DISPATCH
        The orchestrator owns the public actions
        /drone/flight_command (DroneFlightCommand) and
        /cargo_bay/door_command (CargoDoorCommand);
        LAND and ABORT are always legal safety requests
        regardless of allow_manual_flight_actions.
    end note
